{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Humilitas","Vous vivez sur un territoire magnifique fait de collines verdoyantes. Ces Monts et Coteaux, territoires d'élevage du Rhône, ont été façonnés par des générations de paysans. Ils sont environ 1 500 sur le département , les connaissez-vous vraiment ? Avez-vous une vision objective de la réalité de leur vie ? Que ressent-ils au plus profond d'eux, dans une profession qui évolue si vite, au milieu d'une société qui évolue si profondément ? Avec leurs mots et leur coeur, ils vous invitent à découvrir la complexité de leur métier.",[4,5,6],"self-employment","rural","disappearing professions",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":35,"media":38,"synopsis":40,"production":41,"characters":44,"roles":45,"awards":56,"tags":3},"Film","FR2020_096","fr2020-096-humilitas",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2020-01-01",2020,"Documentary",[19,26,31],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Gilles Murigneux","gilles-murigneux",0,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":27,"slug":28,"name":27,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":29,"nationality":24,"awards":30},"Valérie Bochard","valerie-bochard","Female identifying",[],{"id":32,"slug":33,"name":32,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":34},"Jean-Claude Guillaume","jean-claude-guillaume",[],[36,37],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":39,"trailerUrl":12},"https://www.frgdsaura.fr/assets/uploads/GDS69/Rh%C3%B4ne%20Info/Humilitas.jpg?1593525489580",{"native":2,"english":12},[42],{"country":24,"share":43},"Majority coproducer",[],[46,50,53],{"person":47,"role":49},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":48},[],"Director of the film",{"person":51,"role